{
  "additional_concerns": [
    "The scope adds nav > 0, which the circular does not expressly impose. A zero or negative NAV therefore returns OUT_OF_SCOPE even when an applicable SFC designation exists. Establish the treatment of such NAV values rather than treating this computational restriction as a legal exclusion.",
    "Doubling aggregate exposure is mathematically equivalent to the inclusive 50% threshold under the declared exact arithmetic and positive NAV assumption; it does not itself double-count exposure.",
    "The representation refers to a supplied exposure methodology, but no methodology is present in this packet. Look-through, derivative measurement, netting, valuation and assessment timing remain unresolved input questions.",
    "The three missing dependency IDs have no supplied mapping to named authorities. No catalogue match can be inferred.",
    "A FALSE result establishes only failure of the two retained classification routes on established facts. It does not establish compliance with investment limits, sale requirements or distributor duties."
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "authority": {
        "dependency_ids": [],
        "rationale": "The circular and footnote 7 establish this proposition without additional authority.",
        "status": "NONE_DECLARED"
